null,"state":"GA"},{"bioguideId":"D000622","fullName":"Sen. Duckworth, Tammy [D-IL]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-12-11","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"IL"},{"bioguideId":"B001288","fullName":"Sen. Booker, Cory A. [D-NJ]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-08","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NJ"},{"bioguideId":"B001230","fullName":"Sen. Baldwin, Tammy [D-WI]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-15","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"WI"},{"bioguideId":"H000273","fullName":"Sen. Hickenlooper, John W. [D-CO]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-15","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CO"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-17T05:44:36+00:00","id":"s749-119","introducedDate":"2025-02-26","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-04-29","text":"Committee on Veterans' Affairs. Hearings held."},"laws":[],"number":"749","originChamber":"Senate","policyArea":"Armed Forces and National Security","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"M001153","district":null,"fullName":"Sen. Murkowski, Lisa [R-AK]","party":"R","state":"AK"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-02-26","actionDesc":"Introduced in Senate","text":"<p><strong>Justice for ALS Veterans Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill extends increased dependency and indemnity compensation to the surviving spouse of a veteran whom the Department of Veterans Affairs has determined died from&nbsp;amyotrophic lateral sclerosis (ALS or Lou Gehrig's disease) regardless of how long the veteran had such disease prior to death. Under current law, such compensation is paid for a service-connected disability that was rated totally disabling for a continuous period of at least eight years immediately preceding death.</p><p>Under the bill, such extension of increased compensation applies retroactively to veterans who died from&nbsp;ALS on or after October 1, 2022.</p>","updateDate":"2025-05-08T14:26:07Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Justice for ALS Veterans Act of 2025","type":"s","updateDate":"2026-07-08T16:36:13Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-08T16:36:13Z"}
